WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.390
Why is an equals sign like a balance?

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.980
Both sides must weigh the same.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.680
Take 3 from only one side, and it tips.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.280
Take 3 from both, and it stays level.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.320
So x is 4.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:21.013
Whatever you do to one side, do to the other. That keeps it true.
